t @BoardofTrade: http://t.co/i0588TPOE2 #VBOT #WestJet #yvr", "PHOTO: #Canucks Jim Benning, @trevor_linden + Willie Desjardins speak to #Vancouver media at #VBOT. http://t.co/125pStdmK4"], "total_available_comments": 100, "provenance": "Derived from PAN19 English training-split human-author posts; source ID hashed.", "persona_note": "The debate archetype is an assigned simulation lens, not an inferred belief or identity of the source author.", "image_fit": "Supportive / Pro-LGBTQ+ Ally archetype fits meme's theme of rejecting homophobia, transphobia, and ableism.", "persona_scores": {"relevance": 4, "evidence_strength": 4, "diversity_contribution": 3, "complementarity": 3}, "relevance_raw": 0.203006, "unique_comment_count": 6, "selection_reason": "Selected in the highest-scoring trio balancing meme relevance, unique-comment evidence, observable style/language diversity, and distinct comment content.", "selection_score": 3.6, "selected_for_image": true}, {"persona_id": "P_EN_0079", "source_user_hash": "0cbcfc225697", "language": "English", "archetype": "Supportive / Pro-LGBTQ+ Ally", "profile_bio": "", "commenting_habits": {"summary": "often gives detailed posts.", "formality": "Formal", "avg_unit_length": 26.1, "unit": "words", "uses_emoji": false, "emphatic_punctuation": false}, "sample_historical_comments": ["RT @LAYC2015: Great to see Member Groups round the table tonight sharing the universal youth work dialogue and pleased @AlisonDickieSNP cou…", "RT @adamrmcvey: I’ll be at the mound tomorrow 5.30pm &amp; I hope as many of my colleagues will be there too, regardless of party. Surely we ca…", "RT @DadsRockEdin: Great News, we've been awarded funding from the good people of Wester Hailes Com Trust to run 2 free nights for Dads* and…", "The fabulous @JUProctor just voted on as @EdinCentralSNP Branch's new Convener. Watch this space. The branch's future is in good hands. https://t.co/Uyp8MnjLwv", "Packed out Councillor's Cuppa at Cameron House CC today. Lots of iss