k out ‘Buford Tea - Lemon Jelly-MLK - Come, I Have A Dream’ by Buford Tea on #SoundCloud? https://t.co/AdKddyOGEz", "If you have a desire to make it and are willing to take some risks, it is all possible.", "310 push ups in 30 minutes. Not bad for an old guy #healthy #fitness #workout #stillgotit", "Oh Canada! The True North strong and free! Thank you Quebec for choosing unity over division. Welcome home #strongertogether #cdnpoli", "@PierrePoilievre how when you are trying to prevent Elections Canada from communicating with Cdns? @PnPCBC #cdnpoli", "RT @high_on_glitter: RIP Robin Williams We will always love you. You live in our hearts now. http://t.co/JFCIvGj3g3"], "total_available_comments": 95, "provenance": "Derived from PAN19 English training-split human-author posts; source ID hashed.", "persona_note": "The debate archetype is an assigned simulation lens, not an inferred belief or identity of the source author.", "image_fit": "Critical / Conservative perspective may provide insight into conservative or skeptical views on the meme's political subtext.", "persona_scores": {"relevance": 4, "evidence_strength": 4, "diversity_contribution": 3, "complementarity": 3}, "relevance_raw": 0.21826, "unique_comment_count": 6, "selection_reason": "Shortlisted candidate; the final trio had a better combined relevance, evidence, diversity, and complementarity score.", "selection_score": 3.6, "selected_for_image": false}, {"persona_id": "P_EN_0004", "source_user_hash": "fe09bab6355d", "language": "English", "archetype": "Skeptical / Ambiguous Stance", "profile_bio": "", "commenting_habits": {"summary": "often gives detailed posts.", "formality": "Formal", "avg_unit_length": 13.3, "unit": "words", "uses_emoji": false, "emphatic_punctuation": false}, "sample_historical_comments": ["*tidies room* *Finds £160* Best day 💰💰", "Ferrari charging up the hill at Goodwood! #Goodwood #FoS #F1 @… https://t.co/oZD213cYZa", "I've eaten so many Pringles I feel ill #EUref", "Get in @ManorRaci