e author.", "image_fit": "Supportive / Pro-LGBTQ+ Ally, formal and detailed, suitable for analyzing meme's social implications.", "persona_scores": {"relevance": 4, "evidence_strength": 4, "diversity_contribution": 3, "complementarity": 3}, "relevance_raw": 0.186757, "unique_comment_count": 6, "selection_reason": "Shortlisted candidate; the final trio had a better combined relevance, evidence, diversity, and complementarity score.", "selection_score": 3.6, "selected_for_image": false}, {"persona_id": "P_EN_0020", "source_user_hash": "30d72d3eac00", "language": "English", "archetype": "Critical / Conservative", "profile_bio": "", "commenting_habits": {"summary": "often gives detailed posts.", "formality": "Formal", "avg_unit_length": 27.5, "unit": "words", "uses_emoji": false, "emphatic_punctuation": false}, "sample_historical_comments": ["@BryanDawsonUSA A favorite ploy is to starve the administrative funds( hiring, infrastructure)of agencies, causing slowdowns of service, then pointing to slow service as reason to further cut funding. Only pentagon is immune. Limitless funds for them, of course.", "@subsalr While testifying, he could not recall anything he was asked. To be fair, he may not recall that the FBI are his ppl.", "@CherylMichaels1 @fawfulfan @GOP So does the parlimenterian have any authority when it comes to legislation being legal or illegal? Strictly advisory?", "@TomthunkitsMind How many Republicans actually blv Dems want babies aborted near term? That makes no sense, at all. What do Dems do that are against the interests of POC?", "@antonia4347 @krassenstein Straight Dem down the line. Just can't trust anyone who would condone Russian/Trump partnership. America comes first to me, no matter the party.", "@francismmaxwell Why doesn't this matter to ppl unless it's THEIR child or other loved one, WHY? The police rarely killed ppl in the old days. They might beat your ass, but they didn't kill ppl for little things. What changed? Why kill unarmed ppl?"],