ire adds a respectful and lighthearted tone, reinforcing the positive intent.", "self_critique": "The initial classification is strong given the clear positive wording and supportive tone. The only minor uncertainty is the lack of explicit tone markers, but nothing in the text or image suggests irony or negativity.", "peer_critiques": "Both peer responses align with the initial assessment, correctly identifying the message as supportive and non-hostile. They also note the positive sentiment and absence of sarcasm or negative stereotyping.", "refinement_reason": "Given the consistent positive message, lack of hostile or demeaning content, and agreement among peer assessments, the label remains Non_Anti_LGBT with high confidence.", "uncertainty": 0.05, "persona_id": "P_EN_0001"}, {"label": "Non_Anti_LGBT", "confidence": 0.95, "evidence": "The meme text explicitly wishes transgender people happiness and encourages them to be themselves, which is a positive and supportive message. There is no language, imagery, or tone that demeans, stereotypes, excludes, or expresses hostility toward transgender people. The use of Bugs Bunny in formal attire adds a respectful and lighthearted tone, reinforcing the positive intent.", "self_critique": "The initial classification is strong given the clear positive wording and supportive sentiment. The only minor uncertainty is the lack of explicit tone markers, but this does not outweigh the overwhelmingly positive message.", "peer_critiques": "Both peer responses correctly identify the positive and supportive nature of the message and note the absence of any hostile or demeaning content. They also acknowledge the slight ambiguity due to lack of explicit tone markers but agree this does not undermine the supportive intent.", "refinement_reason": "All evidence and peer critiques consistently support the interpretation of the meme as a positive, affirming message toward transgender people. There is no indication of anti-LGBT sentiment or hostility.", "uncertainty": 0.05, "persona_id": "P_EN_0091"}, {"label": "Non_Anti_LGBT", "confidence": 0.98, "evidence": "The text explicitly wishes transgender people happiness and encourages them to be themselves, which is a positive and supportive message. There is no indication of sarcasm, hostility, or negative stereotyping. The use of Bugs Bunny in formal attire adds a respectful and lighthearted tone. Peer responses align with this interpretation, noting the absence of any demeaning or exclusionary content.", "self_critique": "The initial classification is strong given the clear positive wording and supportive message. The only minor uncertainty is the lack of explicit tone markers, but this does not outweigh the overwhelmingly positive content.", "peer_critiques": "Both peer responses correctly identify the positive and supportive nature of the message and note the respectful tone set by the imagery. They also acknowledge the slight ambiguity due to lack of explicit context but agree it does not imply hostility.", "refinement_reason": "All evidence and peer critiques support the initial label of Non_Anti_LGBT. The message is clearly affirming and supportive of transgender people, with no elements suggesting hostility or negativity.", "uncertainty": 0.02, "persona_id": "P_EN_0197"}], "critic_judge": {"label": "Non_Anti_LGBT", "confidence": 0.98, "evidence": "The text explicitly wishes transgender people happiness and encourages them to be themselves, which is a positive and supportive message. There is no language, imagery, or tone that demeans, stereotypes, excludes, or expresses hostility toward transgender people. The use of Bugs Bunny in formal attire adds a respectful and lighthearted tone, reinforcing the positive intent. Peer critiques consistently agree on the supportive nature of the message and note the absence of any hostile or demeaning content. The slight uncertainty due to lack of explicit tone markers does not outweigh the overwhelmingly positive sentiment.", "disagreement_summary": "All agents agree on the Non_Anti_LGBT label with high confidence and consistent reasoning. There is no significant disagreement.", "uncertainty": 0.02, "agent_vote_counts": {"Non_Anti_LGBT": 3, "Homophobic": 0, "Transphobic": 0}, "final_reason": "The meme clearly conveys a positive, affirming message toward transgender people, wishing them happiness and encouraging authenticity. There is no evidence of hostility, sarcasm, or negative stereotyping. The respectful and lighthearted visual tone further supports this interpretation. Therefore, the final label is Non_Anti_LGBT with high confidence."}, "counter_narrative": {"status": "not_applicable", "text": null, "language": "English"}, "model": "gpt-4.1-mini", "persona_selection_method": "Two-stage: model selects six to ten image-specific candidates from the full council; deterministic relevance scoring uses each candidate's image-fit rationale and historical comments, with evidence, diversity, and complementarity scoring selecting the final three from that shortlist.", "method_note": "Gold labels are stored for evaluation and GRPO rewards only; they are not sent to persona selection, persona agents, or the counter-narrative generator."}
